<!-- ═══════ ABOUT ═══════ -->
<section class="sec" id="about">
  <div class="wrap intro">
    <div class="intro-l rv">
      <p class="tag"><i>03</i> About Jalna</p>
      <h2 class="h2" style="margin-top:20px">Manufacturing gateway<br>of <em>Central India</em>.</h2>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 320 190" style="margin-top:38px" aria-hidden="true">
        <g fill="none" stroke="#093C54" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M12 168h296" opacity=".3"/>
          <rect x="46" y="118" width="228" height="14" fill="#0C4A66" fill-opacity=".2"/>
          <path d="M70 132v36M250 132v36"/>
          <path d="M104 112 78 90l16-16 30 24" fill="#0DA1A7" fill-opacity=".5"/>
          <path d="M216 112l26-22-16-16-30 24" fill="#2C8F99" fill-opacity=".4"/>
          <path d="M124 98h72v14a10 10 0 0 1-10 10h-52a10 10 0 0 1-10-10Z" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
          <path d="M96 78V54M136 78V38M176 78V46M216 78V28" opacity=".35"/>
          <circle cx="216" cy="24" r="6" fill="#0DA1A7" stroke="none"/>
        </g>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="intro-b rv">
      <p class="first">Jalna is not starting from zero. It already makes steel, seed and feed for the country, with the industrial base to support what investors build next.</p>
      <p>More than 10% of India's long steel products are manufactured and rolled here. Jalna is also Maharashtra's seed capital and an established centre for feed processing. Industry benefits from continuous, uninterrupted CNG supply and a workforce built for manufacturing at scale.</p>
      <p>A national-scale Multi-Modal Logistics Park anchors the district's freight economy. With the Samruddhi Mahamarg, rail sidings, the nearest airport 45 minutes away, multiple airports within 300 km and India's top six industrial hubs within 500 km, Jalna is positioned as a manufacturing and logistics gateway for Central India.</p>
      <p>The summit brings investors into this existing ecosystem - where power, finance and responsive administration are aligned with industry - to explore new facilities, supplier opportunities and value-added manufacturing.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

