      <p class="lede">The summit's purpose is to turn Jalna's existing industrial strength into its next phase of growth. It brings investors, industry, financial institutions, infrastructure partners and government together around four priorities: a future-ready talent and innovation ecosystem, an industry-friendly investment destination, an MMLP-led logistics gateway, and a manufacturing hub that supports anchor industries.</p>
      <blockquote class="quote">Build the talent. Back the industry. Open the gateway.<cite>Jalna Industrial Summit 2026</cite></blockquote>
